@startuml
title Decorated pulse hits the hallway practice target
actor Player
participant Main
participant GameFacade
participant PulseTraining
participant "Ability chain" as Chain
participant RoomRenderer

note over GameFacade, Chain
  Quest rewards already rebuilt the chain:
  Reach(Swiftness(Power(BasicAbility)))
end note
Player -> Main : Q or Pulse button
Main -> GameFacade : usePulse()
GameFacade -> GameFacade : check game / pause / crystal / room / choice
GameFacade -> RoomRenderer : getTrainingDistance()
RoomRenderer --> GameFacade : distance in logical pixels
GameFacade -> PulseTraining : fire(ability, distance)
PulseTraining -> PulseTraining : check health and cooldown
PulseTraining -> Chain : getDamage(), getRange(), getCooldown()
note right of Chain
  Each decorator delegates to wrapped.
  Power adds 10 damage.
  Reach adds 16 pixels.
  Swiftness multiplies cooldown by 0.65.
end note
Chain --> PulseTraining : 20 damage / 52 radius / 0.52 seconds
alt distance <= radius
  PulseTraining -> PulseTraining : health -= applied damage
  PulseTraining --> GameFacade : HIT or DESTROYED
else distance > radius
  PulseTraining --> GameFacade : OUT_OF_RANGE (cooldown consumed)
end
GameFacade -> RoomRenderer : setTrainingHealth(health), showPulse(range)
GameFacade --> Main : feedback text
Main -> Main : refresh stats, HP and buttons
Main --> Player : target, ring and result visible
@enduml
